{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 46","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/d/5cd17cd296404d0c6d0a3c231fdb77597e9e9348.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/6/0469ff6d4149d895661442a25fb3088c6190dd91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC=7$\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c68227ec2efd9339ffd16251b000f7b70017e121.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />. If sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> are doubled while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> remains the same, then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/6/6565175450b2fe5ee05b740e2c8acbe4cbd50eff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{The area is doubled} \\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{The altitude is doubled} \\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{The area is four times the original area} \\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{The median is unchanged} \\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{The area of the triangle is 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"319\" height=\"96\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After doubling, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/8/0989b5e597cbb93095b7004ecf4f96b43c6fc40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/b/e7b579405b755df5d11b4e8c62d5afd96ed14d58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC= 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />.  Notice that now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/4/dc4a8d098e2c439b72b8b6233244285ebceab949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = AC + BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"134\" height=\"16\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/b/d9bc322bb2445c51fa48e6dd140192fe2c87e9ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{The area of the triangle is 0}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"248\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l4lAvs2P_YA&amp;t=97s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l4lAvs2P_YA&amp;t=97s</a>\n</p><p>~MathProblemSolvingSkills.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"backgrou